# Stale agent/skill definitions kept locally but not published: they describe a
# SQLite store, npm run db:migrate/rollback/seed, a `drop deploy --host` flag
# and a git-receive deploy path -- none of which exist. As *agent instructions*
# they would make a contributor's assistant confidently run failing commands.
#
# Ignored, not merely `git rm --cached`'d: untracking alone is not stable,
# because any later `git add -A` silently re-adds them.
.claude/agents/database-expert/
.claude/skills/db-migrate/
.claude/skills/deploy-app/

